{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1197029-2e-cardman-\u2013-living-cards-kith","id":1197029,"title":"[2E] Cardman \u2013 Living Cards Kith","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-18T21:38:39-07:00","id":1197029,"title":"[2E] Cardman \u2013 Living Cards Kith","content":"Idea I got literally in my last dream. And from playing <b>American McGee\u2019s Alice </b>for years now.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:24px\"><b>Cardman</b></span><br /> They say that life is a game. For Cardmans it\u2019s literal.<br /> <br /> Remade by their Keepers to be living abstractions of game cards suits \u2013 they are used to be just a \u2018game aid\u2019 in mad Fae Feuds, like cards are shuffled before poker night. They are used as living props, but also as part of rules of engagement \u2013 just like normal cards have their own rules to use them. Cardman are mostly looking like they own, preDuration selves \u2013 only they have their Suits symbol taking part of their organs. Hearts are known to have their symbols instead of proper heart they had on Earth. Diamonds eyes could become diamonds symbols. Spades fingers could become spades symbol. Those unfortunate to be remade more extremely can be even literally flattened to become human sized game cards \u2013 however, it\u2019s rare as flat servants are of limited use for Gentry. More often it\u2019s a gloom fate of Cardman becoming Goblin by some unfortunate deal.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Suits</span></b><br /> <b>Hearts</b> <img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f0/SuitHearts.svg/120px-SuitHearts.svg.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/> \u2013<i> Fairest</i> \u2013 Suit of Hearts is really about knowing and pleasing other people. About knowing their \u2018hearts\u2019. <b>Suit Skill:</b> Empathy.<br /> <br /> <b>Diamonds</b> <img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/db/SuitDiamonds.svg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>\u2013 <i>Wizened </i>\u2013 Diamonds are perfectionists. They organise, they plan, they invent. Each one on their own, but is dedicated to the extreme in it. <b>Suit Skill:</b> Academics, Crafts OR Science ( Choose one on character creation )<br /> <br /> <b>Clubs</b> <img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/SuitClubs.svg/111px-SuitClubs.svg.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/> \u2013 <i>Beast</i> \u2013 Clubs are wild and violent. They are direct in what they do and what they want. And best they are at taking things. <b>Suit Skill: </b>Brawl<br /> <b>Spades</b> <img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5b/SuitSpades.svg/111px-SuitSpades.svg.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/> \u2013 <i>Ogre</i> \u2013 Spades are hurt and they are hurting others. They are \u2018sharp\u2019 and they will make you bleed. <b>Suit Skill: </b>Weaponry<br /> <br /> <b>Kith Blessing:</b> When the Cardman uses his Suit Skill Speciality, achieving three successes counts as an<br /> exceptional success.<br /> <br /> <b><i>Deck of Cards:</i></b> A Cardman is part of narrative of Chance. By spending point of Glamour he can re-roll last made roll, but must accept the second result. This ability cannot be used more than once per roll.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T07:23:04-07:00","id":1197177,"title":"","content":"It's not bad for a start, but you know there's a thread for kith creation already right? <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/841149-changeling-kiths-2e/page39\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/841149-changeling-kiths-2e/page39\"> Changeling Kiths (2E) - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/841149-changeling-kiths-2e/page39\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/841149-changeling-kiths-2e/page39 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Here are some conversions of several kiths from both the 1E Changeling supplements (like Winter Masques and Night Horrors: Grim Fears) and the homebrew that's lying </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> If you think that thread is too old, there's a 2e Kith Conversion thread that has also been used to post new Kiths.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1165631-2e-kith-conversion-homebrew\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"